{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.meishu.2022b.q31.material.recovered", "text": "案例：万老师在上“影响艺术中的镜头”一课时，先让学生观看电影《长津湖》片段，然后结合影片中的画面，讲解了“长镜头”“蒙太奇”“全景”“中景”“近景”“特写”等知识。最后，万老师要求学生以小组为单位，结合生活趣事拍摄一部微电影。大多数学生面露难色，不知如何是好。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "382ad343c63f34ec075a0e8622229dd4f349316c1a69808e2635440ccb39cd9e", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2249, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2379, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 31, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "382ad343c63f34ec075a0e8622229dd4f349316c1a69808e2635440ccb39cd9e"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.meishu.2022b.q31"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.meishu.s3.k03", "ntce.gaozhong.meishu.s4.k01", "ntce.gaozhong.meishu.s4.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.design", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.evaluate", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.manage"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.414.r020", "ntce.outline.414.r023"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.meishu.2022b.q31"], "word_count": 130, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "meishu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "382ad343c63f34ec075a0e8622229dd4f349316c1a69808e2635440ccb39cd9e", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2249, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2379, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 31, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "382ad343c6