{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.meishu.2022b.q32.material.recovered", "text": "案例：谭老师在讲授“西方抽象绘画艺术”鉴赏课时，所设定的教学评价要求如下：（1）90%以上的学生初步了解西方抽象绘画的特点及其代表作；（2）80%以上的学生能对抽象绘画感兴趣，并能用画笔尝试创作抽象画；（3）70%以上的学生能够初步自主地欣赏抽象绘画艺术，学生的审美能力有所提高。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "382ad343c63f34ec075a0e8622229dd4f349316c1a69808e2635440ccb39cd9e", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2410, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2550, "next_source_question_number": 32, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 32, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "382ad343c63f34ec075a0e8622229dd4f349316c1a69808e2635440ccb39cd9e"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.meishu.2022b.q32"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.meishu.s1.k02", "ntce.gaozhong.meishu.s1.k08", "ntce.gaozhong.meishu.s4.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.evaluate", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.manage", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.414.r003", "ntce.outline.414.r004", "ntce.outline.414.r005", "ntce.outline.414.r009"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.meishu.2022b.q32"], "word_count": 140, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "meishu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "382ad343c63f34ec075a0e8622229dd4f349316c1a69808e2635440ccb39cd9e", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2410, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2550, "next_source_question_number": 32, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_orde